\f0\fs24 \cf0 #SPECS\
\
The app helps you memorize the words of the Quran. \
\
The idea is to play audio and see if you can remember what comes next.\
\
So a user hears audio 1 then audio 2 is muted giving a pause so they can read out loud what audio 2 should be, then audio 3 is played and audio 4 is muted with a pause and so on.\
\
The user can select the Quran chapter (Surah) and a verse number (Ayat). \
\
The user can hit play on the playback feature that can go back and forward.\
\
The user\'92s last position is always remembered. \
\
The user is shown the arabic and english and a link off to quran.com for that particular verse. E.g. Quran.com/2:24\
\
The user can modify the length of the pause.\
\
The app should have an ability to also a mode where a user can learn the quran by repeating a verse or a group of verses (range).\
\
